# Database Schema

## ERD Diagram
![ERD](assets/erd.png)

## Catatan Penting
- Database lama (CI3): `tpsonline_db`
- Database baru (FastAPI): `tps_core`, `tps_cargo`, `tps_invoice`
- Semua relasi lintas schema akan dihandle melalui API Gateway, bukan `JOIN` lintas database.

### Contoh Model Baru
```python
class CargoHeader(Base):
    __tablename__ = "cargo_header"
    id = mapped_column(Integer, primary_key=True)
    master_awb = mapped_column(String(20), unique=True)
    flight_number = mapped_column(String(10))
    flight_date = mapped_column(DateTime)
    created_at = mapped_column(DateTime, default=datetime.utcnow)
